# Mortgage Loan & Customer Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analyzes mortgage loan applications and customer information using **MySQL and Microsoft Excel**.

The goal is to understand mortgage application performance, customer characteristics, loan trends, loan officer performance, and approval patterns.

This is a fictional business dataset created for SQL and Business Analyst portfolio practice.

## Tools Used

* MySQL
* Microsoft Excel

## Current Database Structure

The project currently contains three tables:

### 1. Customers

Stores customer and financial information.

Key information includes:

* Customer details
* State
* Annual income
* Employment status
* Credit score
* First-time buyer status

### 2. Loan Officers

Stores information about mortgage loan officers.

Key information includes:

* Officer name
* Region

### 3. Loan Applications

Stores mortgage application information.

Key information includes:

* Application date
* Loan type
* Loan amount
* Property value
* Monthly debt
* Application status
* Funding date

## Table Relationships

```text
Customers
    |
    | customer_id
    |
Loan Applications
    |
    | officer_id
    |
Loan Officers
```

## Project Goals

The analysis will eventually answer questions related to:

* Mortgage application volume
* Approval and rejection rates
* Funded loan amounts
* Loan type performance
* Customer credit scores
* Customer income and debt
* Loan-to-Value (LTV)
* Debt-to-Income (DTI)
* Loan officer performance
* Regional performance
* Monthly application trends

